{"channelId":"UCpKbNuRROd1YBVwRz_vvhJw","row":["The Princeton Review",381000,"Founded in 1981, The Princeton Review has long been a leader in helping college and graduate school--bound students achieve their higher-education goals through our test-preparation services, tutoring and admissions resources, as well as through online courses and resources and print and digital books. We deliver our programs via a network of more than 5,000 teachers and tutors in the U.S., Canada, and international franchises. We also partner with schools and guidance counselors worldwide to help provide students with college-readiness, test-preparation and career-planning services. \n\nOur Results\n\nWe are the undisputed test-preparation and admissions experts, and our results speak for themselves. Last year, The Princeton Review helped 3.5 million students realize their college dreams with outstanding results.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpKbNuRROd1YBVwRz_vvhJw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpKbNuRROd1YBVwRz_vvhJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:25.485Z","channelId":"UCpKbNuRROd1YBVwRz_vvhJw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"45727ffa3110e4e412a471eb4f16430f973cdfe66d20ddfa637eb14786ce4351","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8ca080652920032d9b2c1a42c60027105876170290edf95f4b0b0a8bf6a50e34"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpKbNuRROd1YBVwRz_vvhJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:25.485Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpKbNuRROd1YBVwRz_vvhJw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":381000,"raw":"381K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpKbNuRROd1YBVwRz_vvhJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:25.485Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel"